/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:420:front.agreement.s4.body1: "Regarding the copyright of content displayed on Hareruya through User submissions, at the time a post reaches our servers, the User grants us a non-exclusive, royalty-free license (including the right to sub-license) to use such post domestically and internationally (including reproduction, public transmission, disclosure, distribution, transfer, lending, translation, adaptation, and editing). Users also agree not to exercise moral rights over their posts. Users may not copy or use the posts of other Users beyond the scope permitted by these Terms, and may not copy or use any content for purposes other than use on Hareruya. Furthermore, Users may not reproduce, distribute, transmit, or upload such content to other websites for the purpose of providing it to third parties."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:421:front.agreement.s4.body2: "Websites linked from the Hareruya site are operated by other operators. Please use the content of each website at your own responsibility. We cannot be held responsible for any content on such sites."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:422:front.agreement.s4.body3: "Magic: The Gathering is a registered trademark of Wizards of the Coast, LLC. Please contact Wizards of the Coast, LLC regarding their logos, symbols, all card content, and all rights related to Magic: The Gathering. All decklists are posted with permission from the respective websites. This site is not an official site operated by Wizards of the Coast, LLC. All other rights are held by Hareruya, Inc."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:423:front.agreement.s5.title: "5. Personal Information"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:424:front.agreement.s5.body1: "Hareruya may request personal information from Users for user verification and service improvement purposes."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:425:front.agreement.s5.body2: "Personal information provided to us will be used, protected, and managed in accordance with the Act on the Protection of Personal Information and our separately established Privacy Policy."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:427:front.agreement.s6.intro: "In addition to other prohibitions stated in these Terms, Users are prohibited from the following conduct:"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:428:front.agreement.s6.li1: "Knowingly transmitting false information"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:430:front.agreement.s6.li3: "Intentionally transmitting the same information multiple times to assert oneself or harm others"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:433:front.agreement.s6.li6: "Infringement of the intellectual property rights, property, reputation, or privacy of other Users or third parties"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:434:front.agreement.s6.li7: "Conduct that disadvantages other Users or third parties"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:435:front.agreement.s6.li8: "Defamation or slander of other Users or third parties"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:442:front.agreement.s6.li15: "Any other conduct we deem inappropriate"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:445:front.agreement.s7.intro: "We may delete content, images, video, audio, or other digital data posted or uploaded by Users to Hareruya in the following cases, without notifying the User. However, this does not mean that we assume an obligation to monitor all User activities."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:446:front.agreement.s7.li1: "When we determine that the posted content falls under Prohibited Conduct in these Terms, or violates other provisions of these Terms"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:450:front.agreement.s7.li5: "When we receive a request for deletion from another User or a third party with appropriate reason and grounds"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:456:front.agreement.s8.body5: "If a dispute arises regarding our services and we receive a claim from a User or third party, and a court orders payment of damages or other liability, we may seek reimbursement of all costs related to that dispute (including damages, court costs, and attorney fees) from the User who caused the dispute."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:463:front.agreement.s9.li5: "When we determine that service interruption is necessary for other operational or technical reasons"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:464:front.agreement.s9.outro: "We may, at our discretion and regardless of reason, terminate part of Hareruya services or Hareruya operations. In such cases, we will notify Users on Hareruya at least 30 days before the planned termination date. After termination of Hareruya operations, we may, at our discretion, delete posts, comments, messages, and other content stored on our servers. We bear no responsibility for damages suffered by Users due to service changes, interruption, or termination based on this section."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:466:front.agreement.s10.body: "We may revise or modify these Terms without prior notice or notification to Users. Such revisions take effect by posting the new Terms on this page."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:471:front.privacy.intro1: "Personal information handled by Hareruya will be managed securely and used correctly in accordance with the principles set forth in our Privacy Policy."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:472:front.privacy.intro2: "Hareruya provides services on the premise that customers have consented to the handling of personal information and security on the Hareruya website. Please be aware that the content described herein may be changed or revised to provide customers with safer and more secure services, and such changes will be deemed to have been agreed to simultaneously."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:473:front.privacy.s1.title: "1. We will specify the purpose of use before handling customers' personal information."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:474:front.privacy.s1.body: "Personal information handled by Hareruya, including customers' names, dates of birth, addresses, telephone numbers, purchase history, and email addresses, will be used for the following purposes:"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:475:front.privacy.s1.li1: "Sending purchase statements, product invoices, payment notification emails, newsletters, etc."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:479:front.privacy.s1.li5: "Information analysis (such as analysis of purchaser demographics)"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:480:front.privacy.s1.li6: "Product delivery from Hareruya, catalog delivery, and notifications about related services and new products"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:481:front.privacy.s1.li7: "Delivering information about Hareruya mail-order services, store and event announcements"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:482:front.privacy.s2.title: "2. Personal information about customers will be limited to what is necessary to provide services, and we will not collect more information than necessary."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:483:front.privacy.s3.title: "3. When receiving customers' personal information, we will clarify the purpose of use."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:484:front.privacy.s4.title: "4. When using customers' personal information, we will do so within the scope of the purpose of use for which customers have given consent."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:485:front.privacy.s5.title: "5. We will implement necessary and appropriate security measures against risks such as unauthorized access, loss, destruction, falsification, and leakage of customers' personal information."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:486:front.privacy.s6.title: "6. We will thoroughly protect customers' personal information and strive to manage it properly."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:487:front.privacy.s6.body: "We will also strive to educate and raise awareness among employees about personal information protection, and will supervise employees as necessary so that personal information is managed securely."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:488:front.privacy.s7.title: "7. When entrusting the handling of customers' personal information, we will supervise the entrusted party as necessary so that personal information is managed securely."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:489:front.privacy.s8.title: "8. We will not provide customers' personal information to third parties, except with the consent of the customer, or when required by law, or when necessary to protect significant public interests such as life or property."
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:490:front.privacy.s9.title: "9. Personal information collected from customers through the Hareruya website will not be provided or disclosed to third parties, except in the following cases:"
/home/y-saito/Developments/ec-cube-enterprise/src/Eccube/Resource/locale/messages.en.yaml:492:front.privacy.s9.li2: "When entrusting the handling of personal information to contracted companies with confidentiality agreements, within the scope necessary to achieve the stated purposes of use (e.g., contracted companies include delivery companies, printing companies for catalog address labels, credit card companies when card payment is requested, etc.)"
